    <briefdescription>
<para>Collects and submits anonymous usage statistics for a plugin to bStats. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The server owns the metrics behind this handle and retires them when it reloads or shuts down, so a plugin may add its charts in <ref refid="classendstone_1_1Plugin_1ae2a98beb4cfdc042da7e0d7ed0cd5856" kindref="member">Plugin::onEnable</ref> and drop the handle. Asking twice for the same service id gives back the same metrics. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
